Subject: [PATCH] test(llms): Bedrock cache point advances through tool-result
 continuations (red first)

Test-only commit for fork patch 0003. The tests are the test half of upstream
cline/cline#14481 (commits 964e2353c, afb402e98, 5fa67cec1, head 5fa67cec by
marulimo), unchanged: unit tests for applyBedrockCachePointToLastCacheableMessage,
gateway tests, and a wire test through the real gateway and AI SDK with a
stubbed fetch that reads the Converse request body.

Rebased onto cli-v3.0.71 (test files taken from the rebased fork patch 0003, old number 0003).
